  "prefLabel": "Ins 801.12 Access to Data",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 801.12 Access to Data. Statistical agents shall provide access to the commissioner of all statistical data that has been collected. Upon request by the commissioner, the statistical agent shall provide a copy of any report that it produces from data that the commissioner has required to be collected.\n\nSource. #9053, eff 1-2-08; ss by #11008, eff 12-31-15 (from Ins 801.12); ss by #14505, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36 (formerly Ins 801.13)",
